      <data key="d14">async function fetchCheckSummary({ github, owner, repo, headSha, core })</data>
      <data key="d15">// Check results for the PR head, read from the API -- never inferred, and never
// asked of the model. `conclusion` is null while a run is still going, which is
// the normal state on a freshly-pushed head, so "in progress" is a real bucket
// and not an error. Returns null if the checks API is unavailable (the job may
// be running without `checks: read`), in which case the section is omitted.</data>
