    <node id="sym:repo2graph/chunks.py::_lines">
      <data key="d0">sym:repo2graph/chunks.py::_lines</data>
      <data key="d1">symbol</data>
      <data key="d2">_lines</data>
      <data key="d10">_lines</data>
      <data key="d11">function</data>
      <data key="d3">repo2graph/chunks.py</data>
      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">55</data>
      <data key="d13">63</data>
      <data key="d14">def _lines(src: str) -&gt; list[str]:</data>
      <data key="d15">Split source the way tree-sitter counts rows: on "\\n" only.

    str.splitlines() also breaks on U+2028/U+2029/U+0085/\\x0b/\\x0c, which
    tree-sitter's row numbers do not; using it here slices symbol chunks
    from incorrect lines. Drop a trailing "\\r" per line so
    CRLF files still index cleanly.</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry x="4852.67" y="708.00" width="75.00" height="32.50" />
