      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">319</data>
      <data key="d13">359</data>
      <data key="d14">def _separate(
    pos: dict[str, Point], sizes: Mapping[str, Size], iterations: int
) -&gt; dict[str, Point]:</data>
      <data key="d15">Push overlapping boxes apart; the spring layout only knows points.

    The grid cell is as wide as the widest box, so two overlapping boxes always
    share a cell or sit in adjacent ones and no pair is missed.</data>
