      <data key="d13">154</data>
      <data key="d14">def remote_freshness(remote: str, agent_dir: Path, out: Path | str) -&gt; Freshness:</data>
      <data key="d15">Freshness for a remote build: not checkable, and says how to refresh.

    The clone it was built from was deleted, so comparing against any local
    tree -- the working directory, the index's parent -- reports every file as
    added and suggests rebuilding the wrong directory.</data>
      <data key="d_nodegraphics">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry x="4624.90" y="1656.45" width="154.27" height="33.15" />
          <y:Fill color="#57C7E3" transparent="false" />
