      <data key="d14">def index_status(out: Path | str, repo: Path | str | None = None) -&gt; dict[str, Any]:</data>
      <data key="d15">The full report. Raises FileNotFoundError when there is no index.

    Args:
        out: The `-o` output directory (or the `agent/` directory itself).
