    variables: dict[str, Any],
    token: str,
    timeout: float = 30.0,
) -&gt; dict[str, Any]:</data>
      <data key="d15">POST a GraphQL operation and return `data`.

    GraphQL reports failures as HTTP 200 with an `errors` array, so a plain
    `urlopen` success here means nothing on its own -- without this check a
    failed commit would print `None` and the release would carry on.</data>
