      <data key="d12">313</data>
      <data key="d13">342</data>
      <data key="d14">def scene_build(repo: Path, index: Path):</data>
      <data key="d15">Point it at a folder; no setup step, no language server.

    This one runs verbatim what the caption claims -- no `--exclude` -- because
