      <data key="d14">def wide_repo(tmp_path_factory):</data>
      <data key="d15">Read-only source tree above PARALLEL_MIN_FILES; no index is built here.

    Session scoped and never indexed in place: a test that wants an index
    points `-o` at its own `tmp_path`, so nothing written by one test can be
    discovered as a source file by the next.</data>
