      <data key="d14">class FakeOpener:</data>
      <data key="d15">Stand-in for `answer._OPENER`, delegating to a urlopen-shaped callable.

    `stream_answer` goes through an opener rather than `urlopen` so that its
    redirect handler cannot be bypassed (`_SameOriginRedirect`); patching the
    opener is what keeps these tests off the network.</data>
