      <data key="d13">176</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_the_rerank_inverts_container_and_method_ranking(index):</data>
      <data key="d15">End to end, and the whole point of the change.

    Without the re-rank the class header outscores the method that answers the
    question: its docstring repeats the question's words and it is long enough
    to match many of them. With the re-rank the order inverts, so under a
    budget that cannot hold both it is the method that survives.</data>
      <data key="d16">true</data>
