      <data key="d14">def test_a_question_about_tests_restores_the_boost(test_path_index):</data>
      <data key="d15">Withholding it is about *which answer is wanted*, not about test paths
    being second-class. "What tests cover X" is a documented use case.</data>
      <data key="d16">true</data>
