      <data key="d14">def test_a_failed_probe_is_retried_rather_than_cached(mock_run):</data>
      <data key="d15">#239: only a *successful* probe is memoized, exactly as
    fetch._git_version does it. A transient fd-exhaustion or fork failure must
    not disable the cpp fallback for the rest of the process's life -- which is
    precisely what functools.lru_cache would do here.</data>
