      <data key="d14">def test_every_exclusion_glob_matches_its_representative_paths():</data>
      <data key="d15">A pattern that matches nothing is worse than no pattern.

    `parse._glob_re` anchors a pattern containing "/" at the repository root,
    so `vendor/**` silently misses `packages/web/vendor/...` -- which is
    where a monorepo keeps all of it. Each group declares the paths it must
    cover; this runs them through the real matcher.</data>
