      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">480</data>
      <data key="d13">502</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_build_reports_the_resolved_absolute_out_path(tmp_path, capsys):</data>
      <data key="d15">`build` reports the resolved index path, not the `-o` argument verbatim.

    A relative `out` in the report sends a reader looking in whichever directory
    they happen to be in. This was previously guarded only by a sample pasted
    into the quickstart, so it broke silently when that page moved; asserting it
    against the real report keeps it pinned wherever the docs go.</data>
