      <data key="d12">239</data>
      <data key="d13">245</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_primary_seeds_keep_the_short_list_order(trace_repo: Path):</data>
      <data key="d15">`primary_seeds` was `list(a set)`. `expand()` walks its frontier in
