      <data key="d12">138</data>
      <data key="d13">150</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_auth_and_http_server_modules_are_gone_from_disk():</data>
      <data key="d15">The two deleted files must not come back under their old names.

    A restored `auth.py` or `http_server.py` would be dead code at best -- no
    caller is left -- and at worst an unreviewed resurrection of the crypto the
    removal existed to delete. Checked on disk as well as through the import
    system so that a file present but never imported still fails.</data>
