      <data key="d14">def test_releasing_does_not_unlink_a_lock_file_that_is_not_ours(self, tmp_path):</data>
      <data key="d15">release() must not delete whatever happens to sit at the path.

        If the name was replaced while we held our file, the thing at the path
        is another holder's live lock; removing it would admit a third builder.</data>
