      <data key="d14">def test_path_between_visited_ceiling_actually_binds_under_flood(mini_index):</data>
      <data key="d15">A hub with far more direct neighbours than MCP_MAX_PATH_VISITED, none
    of them the (unreachable) target, must report `truncated` rather than
    silently exploring the whole fan-out -- proving the visited cap binds
    on its own, not merely the hop cap (CONTRIBUTING.md: a hop bound alone does
    not bound work on a dense graph).</data>
