      <data key="d13">86</data>
      <data key="d14">def _run_launcher(tmp_path: Path, shim_dir: Path, args: list[str]) -&gt; subprocess.CompletedProcess:</data>
      <data key="d15">Run the launcher with PATH pointing only at `shim_dir`.

    Bytes, never `text=True`: the same decoding discipline CONTRIBUTING.md requires
    for git subprocesses applies to any non-ASCII a shim might echo on a
    cp1252 Windows locale.</data>
