      <data key="d15">A read-only repo tree for the `explain_path` containment properties.

    Session scoped deliberately: `explain_path` only ever stats, so there is no
    per-example state to reset, and a function-scoped `tmp_path` would be rebuilt
    once per *test* while Hypothesis reused it across 100 examples anyway.</data>
