      <data key="d14">def test_max_chars_default_is_what_the_split_properties_assume():</data>
      <data key="d15">A guard so the generated `max_chars` range stays below the real default.

    The `_split` properties drive `max_chars` between 24 and 120 to keep the
    examples small. If `MAX_CHARS` ever drops into that range the production
    default would be inside the generated band rather than above it, and the
    properties would stop saying anything about the shipped configuration.</data>
