      <data key="d14">def test_manifest_defaults_when_the_graph_never_went_through_build(tmp_path):</data>
      <data key="d15">write_manifest has only ever duck-typed `g`, and a Graph assembled by
    hand has no build to inherit a fan-out limit from. It must still write a
    manifest stating the default rather than raising: a wrong number is the
    #245 bug, but no manifest at all is worse than one carrying the default.</data>
