      <data key="d14">def test_explain_path_reports_a_symlink_as_non_regular(tmp_path: Path):</data>
      <data key="d15">`explain-path` must answer for the link, not its target.

    It resolved the path before `lstat`, so a symlink stat'd as its regular-file
    target and was reported INCLUDED -- for a path `discover()` drops, because
    discovery lstats what it walks. Same class as commit 8ddd010.</data>
