      <data key="d3">tests/test_secrets_hardening.py</data>
      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">959</data>
      <data key="d13">976</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_repeated_begin_without_end_stays_linear():</data>
      <data key="d15">The detector for the quadratic form.

    At 200k characters the paired scan takes tens of milliseconds; the lazy
    single-pattern form took ~8 seconds, and ~8 minutes at the 1.5 MB file
    ceiling. The bound below sits far from both, so it survives a slow CI box
    without going vacuous.</data>
