      <data key="d4">python</data>
      <data key="d12">159</data>
      <data key="d13">170</data>
      <data key="d14">def test_the_settle_loop_is_incremental_not_a_blocking_while(tmp_path):</data>
      <data key="d15">Layout must yield to the browser between batches.

    A synchronous `while (alpha &gt; ...) step()` blocks the main thread for the
    whole settle: no paint, no input, no scroll. Bounding the iteration count
    bounds the freeze but does not remove it.</data>
      <data key="d16">true</data>
